# org-lint
Output docs/media/lint.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-lint; clear; DEMO_SNACKS=1 nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/lint.org" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap :Org lint | check the file (org-lint)` Enter
Show
Type ":Org lint"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "j"
Sleep 300ms
Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1.5s
